 "text": "GIS Applications | Sherburne County, MN\nLoading\nSkip to Main Content\nCreate a Website Account - Manage notification subscriptions, save form progress and more.\nWebsite Sign In\nSearch\nTransportation\nParks & Recreation\nProjects\nMapping\nSurveying\nHome\nYour Government\nDepartments I to Z\nPublic Works\nMapping\nGIS Applications\nGIS Applications\n9\n1\n2\n4\nBeacon\nView parcels, aerials and tax information.\nConstruction Projects\nView current road construction and detour information.\nCounty Ditch Projects\nView county ditch projects.\nDaycare Finder\nThis application can be used to find daycare locations in Sherburne County\nOpen Data\nDownload GIS data, link to GIS services and browse web applications.\nROW & Moving Permits\nApply for Right of Way & Moving Permits. Inspection requests can be made here as well\nPublic Notifications\nCreate mailing labels and notification lists.\nSection Corner History\nLocate and view historical survey records and corner tie sheets.\nReport a Concern\nReport issues in county parks, potholes, damaged mailboxes, drainage ditches or other non-emergency traffic problems.\nAdopt A Storm Drain\nHelp keep our waterways clean! Adopt A Storm Drain Today!\nBeacon\nConstruction Projects\nCounty Ditch Projects\nDaycare Finder\nOpen Data\nROW & Moving Permits\nPublic Notifications\nSection Corner History\nReport a Concern\nAdopt A Storm Drain\nReport a Concern\nWe'll Get It Fixed\nParks & Recreation\nLearn More\nSurvey\nLearn More\nMapping/GIS\nGeographic Information\nTransportation\nLearn More\nMaintenance\nLearn More\n-->\nMission: \"To provide accessible and cost-effective services to support quality of life for the Sherburne County community.\"\nContact Us\nSherburne County Govt Center\nATTN: Public Works\n13880 Business Center Drive NW\nSuite 100\nElk River, MN 55330-4668\nPhone:\nGeneral 763-765-3300\nMaintenance 763-765-3400\nFax: 763-765-3366\nFacebook\nQuick Links\nObtain a Permit\nCounty Ordinances\nElections Infor